hestrate/test_at_most_one_invariant.py\tD:test_c_legacy_dedup_key_still_recognized\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/orchestrate/test_at_most_one_invariant.py:L195-199\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/orchestrate/test_at_most_one_invariant.py:L176-178\tA legacy at-most-one dedup key suppresses re-filing the same violation under the current key.\t41\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/orchestrate/test_at_most_one_invariant.py\tD:test_reconcile_once_invokes_invariant_after_fetch\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/orchestrate/test_at_most_one_invariant.py:L332-337\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/orchestrate/test_at_most_one_invariant.py:L311-311\tRun the invariant exactly once on the fetched snapshot before mutation planning.\t28\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/orchestrate/test_at_most_one_invariant.py\tD:test_end_to_end_second_write_produces_one_alert_one_bug\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/orchestrate/test_at_most_one_invariant.py:L392-400\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/orchestrate/test_at_most_one_invariant.py:L366-368\tA clean pass records no alert or ticket CLI call; a violating second pass records one alert and one ticket CLI call.\t65\t22\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/orchestrate/test_at_most_one_invariant.py\tC:Canonical 16-hex format required: invariants\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/orchestrate/test_at_most_one_invariant.py:L125-128\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/orchestrate/test_at_most_one_invariant.py:L109-109\tThe parser requires a canonical 16-hex ID; a miss rolls back the alert.\t42\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/orchest